# Terraform WordPress Deployment

## Description
This project deploys a complete WordPress infrastructure on AWS using Terraform.

## Architecture
- VPC with public and private subnets
- EC2 instance (WordPress)
- RDS MySQL (Multi-AZ)
- EBS volume attached to EC2

## Technologies
- Terraform
- AWS (EC2, RDS, VPC, EBS)

## How to use

```bash
terraform init
terraform plan
terraform apply

## Cleanup

```bash
terraform destroy
